### Get heartbeat
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/heartbeat
content-type: application/json


### Get Feeds
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/feeds/
content-type: application/json


### Push Feeds
PUT http://localhost:8081/api/v1/feeds/
content-type: application/json

